- Every number shown to a user comes from a tested function (api/tariff.py, api/twin.py, web/logic.js), never from free LLM text.
- Never log or print personal data (names, addresses, phone, account or meter numbers).
- UI text is Bangla-first with English alongside.
- Every new feature gets a test in tests/ before it is merged.
- Label simulated data "Simulated" everywhere it appears.
